            <lg xml:id="m-5bf8d0a2-489f-4284-af64-bbdaca8bf743">
              <l xml:id="m-782c257d-f619-46a2-af72-51157182a38e" facs="#m-40e155d8-65f4-48b9-9b34-08ac70e31c3a" label="ambiguous">Ianuary 18.</l><l xml:id="m-eefdb555-ec5f-4cab-b33d-61052900ab70" facs="#m-57108235-4264-4a86-9577-2a0e94c8c6c6" label="ambiguous">1334</l><l xml:id="m-88a9ec47-fde7-484d-a1ab-69d0eae02fc4" facs="#m-5a8b0917-2b93-4f9d-8ca3-37a296a1fc0d" label="ambiguous">tae infe-ri</l><l xml:id="m-bc0512ac-9e8b-4e71-9cf6-e0167fe47e11" facs="#m-60198312-9e4a-44f6-a9a1-0999ba728423" label="lyrics-like">non praeva-lé¬ bunt advér¬</l><l xml:id="m-2c741a51-72c9-4b95-a1af-e004765c4e28" facs="#m-6e2b5eaa-c079-4ec2-b17c-eadf84919167" label="lyrics-like">am: et tí-bi dá- bo clá¬ ves régni cae¬</l><l xml:id="m-1b0dc490-6a12-42ad-bec7-0cd581187bdf" facs="#m-874358ff-38cf-4f75-ac71-0918ee2122a9" label="lyrics-like">sus é¬</l><l xml:id="m-40961a67-1576-45d5-82db-fa66f3797c7c" facs="#m-ecafed44-ae2c-40da-9ca0-8dc501762cdb" label="lyrics-like">ló¬</l><l xml:id="m-9cd8c9f9-def8-42de-923e-f715022de0c7" facs="#m-834b62d8-7b2a-4d3e-a997-48b4326f9ce7" label="ambiguous">rum.</l><l xml:id="m-142c1a2b-3bf1-4e01-838d-91cd60954a8b" facs="#m-e57108af-07ff-46ff-9cb0-8a4a6bc3a4d2" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-f68e6bd5-ad1d-4460-8d14-6a32e5f6eedc" facs="#m-08612e04-ddb1-4578-8389-89cc8ae87569" label="lyrics-like">"Cclésiae tuae, quaésumus Dó-lut quod pro illius glória celebrá¬</l><l xml:id="m-bef83dcd-e15f-4930-8769-e44b03d66e65" facs="#m-22e908b6-9a29-46b7-9035-be0ae43184e1" label="lyrics-like">C mine, preces et hóstias beáti] mus, nobis prosit ad véniam. Per</l><l xml:id="m-bed2ed09-4475-48be-9a99-77f5b6c33c67" facs="#m-fdc4fdea-b63f-45c7-9cec-fd0c14aaa343" label="lyrics-like">Petri Apóstoli comméndet orátio :! Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-2d6a91d1-267e-4618-a658-5cd3c8bffeca" facs="#m-dae09ef1-6664-4e4e-89bc-ef8dd8afd91d" label="lyrics-like">Of St. Paul. Secret. Apóstoli tui Pauli. p. 1347.</l><l xml:id="m-8fb2f2ad-79bf-4f43-99ed-15c0237c801d" facs="#m-e4294fb9-f597-4215-93b8-567ee680c8b7" label="text-like">Of St. Prisca. Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-dfd0845a-e566-46a9-a121-7a7118841305" facs="#m-0b26dfd3-29f5-4d2b-a762-189e9288421d" label="lyrics-like">Aec hóstia, quaésumus Dómine,! cula nostrae pravitátis absólvat, et</l><l xml:id="m-95bb605e-9614-4ab1-8a62-8fc67d19b35d" facs="#m-40fab0c3-be99-445e-b52a-10238ff9c384" label="lyrics-like">Il quam sanctórum tuórum nata-l tuae nobis misericórdiae dona con¬</l><l xml:id="m-eb74a470-031b-4f8f-b482-a2a976b9f5f4" facs="#m-e0d06be3-613c-46ca-8315-41fa23adfd42" label="lyrics-like">litia recenséntes offérimus, et vin-l ciliet. Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-7c1ec506-96c2-45c1-a7e1-8e059551823e" facs="#m-b3e6fba7-94cb-4768-9a11-8205487bfe57" label="text-like">Preface of the Apostles, p. 10.</l><l xml:id="m-eb2efb50-0305-4416-8cf8-36b10f572d74" facs="#m-40348383-9bf9-482a-b842-3e116409f10b" label="lyrics-like">Communion. Tu es Pétrus. p. 1521.</l><l xml:id="m-add69269-be30-41eb-95fb-57cc38d880b9" facs="#m-60ce2742-41fc-4300-b2bf-f397f025c00b" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-85244fb5-9733-47fd-b4f1-490a5f9fae1d" facs="#m-e87e7e64-a142-4e80-9875-e57c5e4087d6" label="lyrics-like">Aetíficet nos, Dómine, munus! mus; sic per illum tuae sumámus</l><l xml:id="m-eb5cd5c5-b20a-42ce-9010-ddb1d8c0da44" facs="#m-608d90f1-ea21-470e-b2df-0ef7691e0ec0" label="lyrics-like">Ii oblátum: ut sicut in Apóstolo lindulgéntiae largitátem. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-9b90f39a-ea84-45a4-abd0-2747366e441d" facs="#m-7840d74d-3224-4df9-aab0-73f120c162f6" label="lyrics-like">tuo Petro te mirábilem praedicá-l minum.</l><l xml:id="m-6d7b99b3-94b5-4465-9bbc-78e8e56bc4b4" facs="#m-935d6cdf-0601-42c6-9701-e06c23623366" label="lyrics-like">Of St. Paul. Postcommunion. Sanctificáti. p. 1347.</l><l xml:id="m-bd105037-b40e-47b8-a3bf-62980be36742" facs="#m-df7d41f5-814d-4e5a-8d09-6735a3de12ae" label="text-like">Of St. Prisca. Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-33bf346c-c26d-4047-9596-d5527f6471f1" facs="#m-44210942-b1c6-4568-92cb-401b7e8e8522" label="lyrics-like">Uaésumus, Dómine, salutáribus! lémnia celebrámus, eius ocatióni¬</l><l xml:id="m-e39707e0-b62b-429b-b013-b120b9ff3915" facs="#m-f374f091-f8d1-4ab0-84dd-ca8ad899a666" label="lyrics-like">U repléti mystériis: ut cujus so-l bus adjuvémur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-8481c762-76ba-4968-887e-974934e4cbc1" facs="#m-ae407315-33d4-489f-9fcb-c1a994f6d0e7" label="text-like">At Second Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-e73e4d11-78e4-4526-a7da-0e6769f13bf6" facs="#m-5ad06ea1-973b-4df3-9b7d-4f037f2e76ad" label="text-like">All from the Common of a Confessor. Bishop, p. 1176, except the follouing:</l><l xml:id="m-959a2fc0-95f5-4325-bd43-e0d21265c3d2" facs="#m-44e10cd4-a58d-4c2e-99a7-2d6d61af2ada" label="ambiguous">Hymn.</l><l xml:id="m-8ca5f14f-6004-43ad-b3f4-13e3ae5b88db" facs="#m-3006d72c-34c3-4515-93f5-35a1251c346f" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-3520e2a5-313f-4acf-8b16-af859d89fc79" facs="#m-dc312603-53f1-4b24-9d62-3734cf1081a1" label="lyrics-like">Uodcúmque in órbe néxibus re-vinxe-ris,</l><l xml:id="m-29c49e05-29c2-4481-bff0-42528bd55a83" facs="#m-3b02d91b-d766-4649-aff7-2613cb6b3347" label="ambiguous">Erit</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>